Cost of ONE potential step e^{-iE(w)dt}, n=8 qubits

  width   Pauli-rotation route      ancilla-arithmetic route
          gates   (body-order)      gates   depth   ancillas
  --------------------------------------------------------------------
    0.5     255       (k<=8)         1045     897       8
    1.0     254       (k<=7)         1045     897       8
    2.0     246       (k<=6)         1045     897       8
    4.0     218       (k<=5)         1045     897       8
    8.0     162       (k<=4)         1045     897       8

The Pauli route grows as the barrier thins (2^n in the limit).
The arithmetic route does NOT depend on the shape of E at all - it is the
same circuit with different rotation angles.
